## AI Code Review Agent

An autonomous AI-powered code review and refactoring application built using **LangGraph, LangChain, OpenAI and GitHub REST API**.
The application analyzes Python files in a GitHub Pull Request, identifies code quality issues using Flake8, generates improved code using an LLM, and requests human approval before applying changes to the GitHub branch.

## Features

- **GitHub Integration:** Fetches modified Python files directly from GitHub Pull Requests.
- **Automated Code Analysis:** Uses Flake8 to identify linting errors.
- **AI-Powered Refactoring:** Uses OpenAI's GPT-4o-mini model to improve code readability and fix linting issues while preserving functionality.
- **Human-in-the-Loop (HITL):** Requires reviewer approval before modifying GitHub files.
- **Feedback-Based Refactoring:** Rejected suggestions are regenerated using reviewer feedback.
- **Persistent Checkpointing:** Uses SQLite to maintain workflow state across interruptions.
- **FastAPI Integration:** Provides API endpoints for triggering code reviews and submitting approval decisions.
## Architecture

The application uses LangGraph to orchestrate the code review workflow.

### Workflow
        
             GitHub Pull Request
                      |
                      v
                Fetch PR Node
                      |
                      v
                Lint Code Node
                      |
                      v
             Propose Refactor Node
                      |
                      v
             Human Approval Node
                      |
                +-----+-----+
                |           |
             Approved     Rejected
                |           |
                v           v
          Apply Changes   Reviewer
             Node         Feedback
                |           |
                v           v
              END      Propose Refactor
                            |
                            v
                     Human Approval

## Workflow Components

Component	Responsibility
Fetch PR Node	Retrieves modified Python files from GitHub.
Lint Code Node	Analyzes Python files using Flake8.
Propose Refactor Node	Generates improved code using GPT-4o-mini.
Human Approval Node	Interrupts execution and waits for reviewer input.
Apply Changes Node	Commits approved changes to the PR source branch.
SQLite Checkpointer	Persists workflow state and supports resuming execution.

